==English==

===Pronunciation===
*{{audio|en-us-illiteracy.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|illiterac|ies|-}}

# {{uncountable}} The [[inability]] to [[read]].
#: '''''Illiteracy''' is widespread in certain areas of the country.''
# {{countable}} A denigrated word or phrase or grammatical turn, the use of which is one which brands the user as ignorant and uneducated (e.g., [[ain't]], [[irregardless]], or the use of the [[double negative]]).
#: ''Using an adjective as an adverb, as "He talked friendly to me" is considered an '''illiteracy''' by some.''

